{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "QMUQANVZNJDZEUUX5QV6HZNYI4BJC66R",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041133003",
    "title": "第3章 歴史の持つ“引力”",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 3: The \"Gravity\" of History",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "私の母は、年代学者で……家に、立派な書斎を持っていました。\nそこには、種々様々な『歴史の本』があって――",
            "enText": "My mother is a chronologist… Back at home, she had a magnificent study. It was filled with all sorts of \"History Books\"—",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 337,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 390,
                    "pathId": -1371757574274953098
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": -8049062107631394370
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8618164678593611818,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "まだ幼い頃、私がとりわけ夢中になったのは……\nウマ娘たちの『レース史』でした。",
            "enText": "Back when I was little, the thing that captivated me the most… was the \"History of Racing\" of horsegirls.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 250,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 375,
                    "pathId": 2184167253368069023
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -7380918225327312665
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3884148934121770529,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "レース史には、深いドラマがあった……それも、その娘個人で\n完結するものではない――紡がれた歴史、その上にあるドラマが。",
            "enText": "Racing history is full of profound drama… and it's not something that ends with just one individual — it's the drama found atop a woven history.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 399,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 33,
                    "pathId": 5387294420005860712
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7426811592053694077,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……どうしようもなく、わくわくしました。過去を知れば\n知るほど大きくなっていく、その壮大な“絵巻物”に。",
            "enText": "…I couldn't help but be excited. The more I learned about the past, the larger that grand \"picture scroll\" became.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 307,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 318,
                    "pathId": -1165881799965752524
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3777731647255008087,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "歴史とは“絵”です。レースに携わる全ての者たちが描いた数多の\n“点”が繋がり、線になることで浮かび上がる――巨大な一枚絵。",
            "enText": "History is a \"painting\" Countless \"dots\" drawn by all those involved in racing connect to form lines, revealing — a single, massive canvas.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 360,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 371,
                    "pathId": -87070816505868941
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4949463843621738655,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "シンボリルドルフは輝かしい点を記しました。けれどその先に――\nトウカイテイオーが。連なる彼女たちがいることで、絵は完成した。",
            "enText": "Symboli Rudolf marked a brilliant dot. But beyond her — lay Tokai Teio. Because of all the girls who followed in her footsteps, the painting was completed.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 425,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 467,
                    "pathId": 8179118572328534973
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": 4464765633676568542
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": -4570866055675540814
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -3354667687780551603
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 156,
                    "pathId": 3818372023472482563
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3295480142912363586,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "スペシャルウィーク、グラスワンダー、エルコンドルパサー……\nあの世代の誰が欠けても、あそこまで美しい絵にはならなかった。",
            "enText": "Special Week, Grass Wonder, El Condor Pasa… had any one of those girls been absent from their era, the painting wouldn't be the masterpiece it is today.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 349,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 467,
                    "pathId": 7409263675576047465
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 417,
                    "pathId": -3323597292717214398
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -5299820908946348653
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -1333783315665222202
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 201,
                    "pathId": -8598068385060255767
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 351,
                    "pathId": 7811607827325463664
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -429154814315001102
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8245377744353415710,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……それらの事実に気づいた時にはもう、私は……\n魅入られていました。歴史に。そして――",
            "enText": "…By the time I realized those truths, I was already… captivated. By history. And—",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 362,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": 3285970987947127464
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -500019958613568195
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -4216496700177301663
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2951975037202414307
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -2301671443103179456
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2962714606382872428,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "その絵の中に、いたいと思いました。",
            "enText": "I felt that I wanted to be inside that painting.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 4301011389774508806
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6139251696441227806,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "グランちゃん、ラヴちゃんはこれから、点を描きます。\n私も、そうしたいけど……。",
            "enText": "Gran and Love are about to make their marks. I want to do the same, but……",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 283,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 333,
                    "pathId": -5714625142784104869
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
                    "pathId": 35007600978128352
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -8899971582284656948
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 340,
                    "pathId": -6470464818061144327
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 226,
                    "pathId": 8532650338983852567
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6021070795662153433,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "まだ、足りない。全然。歴史を紡いできた先達に……\nこれから紡ぐであろう彼女たちに。",
            "enText": "I'm still lacking. Completely. Not just against the legends of the past… but also against my friends, who are about to carve out the future.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 317,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 399,
                    "pathId": 5506057803095036461
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 6610724339722407824
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -7251541218474691440
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 340,
                    "pathId": -5646424681981600162
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -6345984965468626101
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8840945748160064884,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……それが、嫌なんです。\n足りない自分を許してはいけない。だって――",
            "enText": "…I hate that. I mustn't forgive my own inadequacy. Because—",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 268,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 164,
                    "pathId": -271717242444751200
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 852697830116514026
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -408611422802461435,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そんな歴史を紡ぎたいんです、私も。",
            "enText": "I want to be a part of weaving that history, too.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": -3497398865221120418
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 188,
                    "pathId": 8311906374954073008
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8674078433693573897,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "――あの頃の私のような誰かを、わくわくさせたい。\nそう、思っていて……。",
            "enText": "—I want to give someone else that same sense of wonder I felt as a child. That's what I'm striving for…",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 212,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": 267032270427591158
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -3911372103205534880
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6893392116219192182,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "…………あっ。す、すみませんっ……！\n一人で、長々と……。",
            "enText": "…………Ah. I-I'm so sorry…! I've been talking for so long, all by myself…",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 150,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いや。……話してくれてありがとう",
                    "enText": "Not at all. …Thanks for sharing with me",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ううん。……話してくれてありがとう",
                    "enText": "Not at all. …Thanks for sharing with me",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": -4255487640421186938
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3979233950875050526
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6596852800976607741,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女が根を詰める理由がわかった。――夢があるから。\nそのために、努力を惜しみたくないようだ。",
            "enText": "I finally see the reason behind her intense focus. —She has a dream. And to achieve it, she's willing to put in every ounce of work she can.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 230,
                    "pathId": -5194716832202303927
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 191,
                    "pathId": 4695464297872913767
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2207524625439084271,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……もちろん、大言壮語だって、\nわかってはいるんですけど……。",
            "enText": "…Of course, I know that it's a grand ambition to have…",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 183,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そんなことないよ。――そんなことない",
                    "enText": "That's not true. —Not in the slightest",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 205,
                    "pathId": 5850201054390575860
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 118,
                    "pathId": -3666456437587546240
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1863976724670060923,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……トレーナーさん。",
            "enText": "……Trainer.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 137,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -3573864716775984441
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3912344468898609289
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4918906749574142033,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "だって現に自分は、模擬レースで“もったいない”と思った。\n何かが変わるだけで、彼女は大物になれる――そんな確信がある。",
            "enText": "Because in that mock race, I really felt that she was <i>holding back.</i> I'm convinced that with just a small shift, she could become a legend — I'm sure of it.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 121,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 199,
                    "pathId": -2101481452550578266
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4099182381589534253,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……その。実は2週間後に、トレセン学園見学会というのがあって。\nレースファンの方々を招いて行うイベントなのですが……。",
            "enText": "……Actually. In two weeks, there's a Tracen Academy Open Day. It's an event where we invite racing fans to visit……",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 381,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": -4563911675933115222
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": -785985137256655312
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -690401539961333988,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そこで行われるイベントレースに出走するんです。\nだから、下手な走りはしたくなくて……。",
            "enText": "I'll be running in an event race that's being held there. That's why I don't want to put on a poor performance…",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 258,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そっか、だから……",
                    "enText": "I see, so that's why…",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 249,
                    "pathId": 5699325969473387217
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": -8148766823653094588
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 539867229174313932,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……夢の話を聞いて、彼女の熱意を知って。\nそうしたら自然と、言葉が口から零れていた。",
            "enText": "…Hearing about her dream and knowing her passion. \nBefore I knew it, the words just naturally slipped out of my mouth.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "よかったら、俺にも手伝わせてくれない？",
                    "enText": "If it's okay, would you let me help you?",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "よかったら、私にも手伝わせてくれない？",
                    "enText": "If it's okay, would you let me help you?",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": -2145084497705366610
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 297713856297182730
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1838341907356178913,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "後日、クロノジェネシスにお願いし、過去のレース映像を何個か\n見させてもらう。……彼女はどのレースも思案げな顔で走っていた。",
            "enText": "A few days later, I asked Chrono Genesis to let me watch several videos of her past races. …In every single one, she was running with a pensive look on her face.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 6049511337321918059
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -3035411653944829694
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 135,
                    "pathId": 3885312169252857700
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5550408307672306548,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "こっちは、『阪神ジュベナイルフィリーズ』……\nブエナビスタさんが勝ったレースを参考に、位置取りをしました。",
            "enText": "Here, in the \"Hanshin Juvenile Fillies\"… I chose my position based on the way Buena Vista ran when she won.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 255,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "内にもスペースがあるけど、そこには？",
                    "enText": "What about the opening on the inside?",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 447,
                    "pathId": 1615670943129463160
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5503095097641618762,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……正直、迷いました。ブエナさんの翌年は、内から差した\nウマ娘が勝ったので。どちらを参考にすべきか……。",
            "enText": "…To be honest, I was torn. The year after Buena-san's, the winning horsegirl came from the inside. I wasn't sure which one to use as a reference…",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 357,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 447,
                    "pathId": 2552698138104350689
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -879095264380265314,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "でも、そのまま外から。内を走る8番が、過去の模擬レースを\n観ても、よれる傾向にある娘でしたから。ここは勝つために――",
            "enText": "But I stayed on the outside. Looking at past mock races, #8 on the inside had a tendency to veer off course. To ensure the win—",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 334,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……いつもそんなに考えながら走ってるの？",
                    "enText": "…Do you always think this much while running?",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 440,
                    "pathId": -1403931455382411760
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 436,
                    "pathId": -5356703689220326661
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -3785881353078644762
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8958300795077504223,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "はい。歴史は“すでにある事実”なので……\nそれを利用しない手はないと思いますから……。",
            "enText": "Yes. History is an \"proven fact,\" after all… I feel like it would be a waste not to make use of it…",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 225,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "なるほど……",
                    "enText": "I get it now……",
                    "nextBlock": 28
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 278,
                    "pathId": 819469902468585441
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7453931631025104650
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -729645966432835579,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "クロノジェネシスの解説とともに、彼女のレースを\n観て気づいたことがあった。それは――",
            "enText": "As I watched her races alongside her commentary, I noticed something. That was—",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "レース中、考えすぎてるかも！",
                    "enText": "You're overthinking during your races",
                    "nextBlock": 29
                }
