                {
                    "origLen": 204,
                    "pathId": 4861895246474109870
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3702679219958899018,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "レース史に造詣が深いのは彼女の武器ではある。だけど――それを\n参照しようとしすぎるあまり、頭でっかちになっている印象だ。",
            "enText": "Her profound knowledge of racing history is certainly a weapon. However—I get the impression she's becoming too top-heavy by trying to reference it all the time.",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "もっと、何も考えずに！自由に走ろう！",
                    "enText": "Just run free! Don't overthink it",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -747086784950107813
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
