            "pathId": 7632118493369138260,
            "blockIdx": 36
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "私らしい走りって、なんなのか……。",
            "enText": "I wonder what my true way of running really is…",
            "nextBlock": 38,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": 29,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "それを考えることもしなくていいと思うよ",
                    "enText": "Don't even worry about that",
                    "nextBlock": 38
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 142,
                    "pathId": -9095010644999860866
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 266,
                    "pathId": 2741550422085014937
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3201858176533687272,
            "blockIdx": 37
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "何を考えずとも、自然としている走り――それが『彼女の走り』\nのはず。だから本当に、“何も考えない”が大事なのだけど……。",
            "enText": "The way she runs when she isn't thinking about anything at all — that should be her \"true style.\" That's why \"thinking about nothing\" is so important, but…",
            "nextBlock": 39,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 138,
                    "pathId": -2520546814765697478
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
