                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -2702541833890735256
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1821581385438287139,
            "blockIdx": 39
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "結局『考えずに走ろう！』だけでは、問題解決の助言として\n足りていないのだろう。であれば、もっと有益なアドバイスを――",
            "enText": "As it turns out, just telling her \"Don't think, just run!\" wasn't a sufficient enough tip to solve her problem. I need to come up with some more constructive advice—",
            "nextBlock": 41,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 1260590529700567819
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1057271700878465271,
            "blockIdx": 40
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……あげたいけれど、現状思いつけていない。――ならば、\nどうする？　歴史好きな彼女が求める答えを、探すとしたら……。",
            "enText": "…I want to give her that advice, but right now, I can't think of anything. — If so, what do I do? If I were to look for the answer a history-lover like her is searching for…",
            "nextBlock": 42,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……ウマ娘ミュージアム、行ってみようか？",
                    "enText": "…How about we go to the Museum?",
                    "nextBlock": 42
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "……ウマ娘ミュージアム、行ってみない？",
                    "enText": "…How about we go to the Museum?",
                    "nextBlock": 42
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 35019359876493589
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5457963522898198084,
            "blockIdx": 41
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "クロノジェネシスは歴史とともに歩んできた。そんな彼女に、\nレース中は歴史を切り離せ、と望むのは難しい。なら――",
            "enText": "Chrono Genesis has lived her life alongside history. Expecting someone like her to simply cut herself off from history during a race is too much to ask. If that's the case, then—",
            "nextBlock": 43,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "君にとって歴史とは何なのか、再考しよう",
                    "enText": "Let's rethink what history is to you",
                    "nextBlock": 43
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "貴方にとって歴史とは何なのか、再考しよう",
                    "enText": "Let's rethink what history is to you",
                    "nextBlock": 43
                }
