            "pathId": -6886066303242090240,
            "blockIdx": 43
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "いえ、その……特別展示があったので、つい……。\nこの間は、そんなのなかったのに……。",
            "enText": "No, well… there was a special exhibit, so I just… There wasn't anything like this here the other day……",
            "nextBlock": 45,
            "origClipLength": 261,
